%
% The warrant set for mikemol-fence. ONE ENTRY PER TEST FUNCTION, and the gate enforces the
% 1:1 against `grep -cE '^(    )?def test_'` over tests/.
%
% TRANSCRIBED, NOT AUTHORED: each claim is the first paragraph of its test's own docstring,
% because the prose was written at the moment the defect was measured. A thin docstring
% yields a thin claim -- a fact about the case rather than licence to invent one.
%
% THIS DISTRIBUTION'S TESTS ARE CLASS METHODS, and that is why the ledger was empty until
% 2026-09-10: both counting sites read `^def test_` anchored at column 0, so the harness
% counted ZERO here and an empty ledger satisfied 1:1 while 33 real tests went unwarranted.
% The predicate was widened rather than the tests restyled -- the classes group meaningfully
% and the instrument was the thing that could not see them.

@misc{fence-caps-root-cgroup-line-is-the-hierarchy-root,
  section = {caps},
  claim   = {`0::/` names the root itself, not a child of it.},
  check   = {cmd:.venv/bin/python3 -m pytest tests/test_caps.py -k test_a_root_cgroup_line_is_the_hierarchy_root}
}

